     partition case (each way's comment names its owner). Way 224 crosses the valley box's west
     edge; way 225 lies far outside it; the lake (relation 401) crosses its south edge, and its ways
     305 and 307 lie wholly outside, so only a smart cut holds the whole lake. Objects are sorted by
     type and id, as osmium extract requires. -->
